 body.innerHTML='<section id="usageConsentV236" class="journey-card usage-consent-popup"><span class="eyebrow">HELP SHAPE THE GAME</span><h2>Help measure returning players?</h2><p>Basic game totals are reported without a persistent ID. Optionally allow a random installation ID to measure unique and returning players. You can turn either kind of reporting off in Settings.</p><div class="journey-actions"><button type="button" class="btn neutral" data-usage-no>Keep basic only</button><button type="button" class="btn primary" data-usage-yes>Allow ID tracking</button><a href="usage-privacy.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Details</a></div></section>';
